    "text": "\n\nI can see the two bugs:\n1. **Bug 1**: Malformed rows with missing temperature cause a crash when trying to convert to float\n2. **Bug 2**: The condition `temperature > 350.0` excludes 350.0, but the vendor spec says 350.0 is the inclusive upper limit, so 350.0 should be \"ok\", not \"high\"\n\nLet me fix both issues:\n\n",
